{"updated":"2026-11-20T03:58:02.555Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"Df8qr1UCMxf","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df8qr1UCMxf","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"兩天做出一款 3D 回合制遊戲，角色是誰建的？\n\nMeng To 給四個角色各一張參考圖，用 Claude Code（Fable 5.2）透過 MCP 呼叫 Hi3D。Claude Code 負責串流程，Hi3D 負責把參考圖轉成 3D 模型，最後把四隻角色放進 Three.js 遊戲。\n\n這套流程最有意思的地方：你可以先拿一張角色圖試做，再看模型匯入後的比例、材質和動畫要修多久。省下多少工，就看這一步。\n\n作者原文：threads.com/@meng…","timestamp":"2026-11-20T03:15:56.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T11:59:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df8etYAOXrI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df8etYAOXrI","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"兩張圖差在哪？把中間那條線往旁邊拉，比來回切圖更直覺。\n\nTuneShape 的「彈性圖片比較」可以直接試滑桿，也能換成自己的圖、調分割線位置和反應速度，最後匯出 JSON 設定。\n\n拿來比遊戲 UI 改版、照片修圖前後，或網站重做前後都很適合。影片先用官方示範圖跑一遍，原始碼放下一則。","timestamp":"2026-11-20T01:31:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T11:59:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df8eyUkCPfm","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df8eyUkCPfm","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"TuneShape 開源專案：github.com/oroco…","timestamp":"2026-11-20T01:31:57.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T11:59:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df8TzW0B7xh","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df8TzW0B7xh","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"今年在 GitHub 做了什麼？我做了 RecapLion，把一整年的 commit、專案和開發習慣整理成一份會動的年度回顧。\n\n還能把解鎖的成就匯出成動畫 SVG，放進 GitHub 個人 README。想分享又怕露出私有專案？也可以只用公開資料。\n\n如果只能選一個作品代表你的 2026，你會選哪個？","timestamp":"2026-11-19T23:55:51.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T11:59:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df8aAp2H26k","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df8aAp2H26k","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"GitHub：github.com/malil…\n公開回顧：malilion.github.io/Recap…","timestamp":"2026-11-20T00:49:38.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T11:59:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df7ZrDOzJim","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df7ZrDOzJim","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Gemini 4 Neon 不只是 Gemini 又多了一個名字。Google 的示範甚至把圖靈的書房做成可以探索的 3D 場景。\n\n這支影片用兩分鐘整理：Neon 跟 Carbon、Hydrogen 怎麼選、在哪能用，以及官方公布的成績怎麼看。\n\n來源：blog.google/innov…","timestamp":"2026-11-19T15:28:58.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df6057SiKmX","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df6057SiKmX","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"會用 AI 不等於要從零訓練模型。想搞懂「文字丟進去之後發生什麼」，可以從 Hugging Face 的免費 LLM Course 開始。\n\n先不用把 Transformer 論文啃完。今晚花 10 分鐘，打開課程裡的「標記器」小節，拿同一句中文和英文給同一個 tokenizer，看看各被拆成幾個 token，再加個 emoji 比一次。你會更有感：字數跟 token 數不是一回事。\n\n📚 Hugging Face 官方課程：huggingface.co/learn…","timestamp":"2026-11-19T10:06:44.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Df6hsZxG1_2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df6hsZxG1_2","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Animate UI，作者 Skyleen。\nTabs 示範：animate-ui.com/docs…\nGitHub：github.com/imsky…","timestamp":"2026-11-19T07:18:17.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Df6hpakgJbF","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df6hpakgJbF","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"同樣一組頁籤，底線用「跳的」跟「滑的」，切換起來差多少？👀\n\nAnimate UI 可以讓 shadcn/ui 的 Tabs 保留原本樣式，切換時讓選取底線滑到新位置。\n\n如果你的專案已經有 shadcn/ui 的 Tabs，可以照留言裡的官方文件，在 animate tabs 指令後加上 --dry-run，先看它會改哪些地方，不用一開始就把整站一起改。\n\n我會先用在設定頁或作品集分類。動一下就好，重點是讓人知道自己切到哪一頁。","timestamp":"2026-11-19T07:18:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Df6fuA2CVr1","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df6fuA2CVr1","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"作品與實機畫面由 wquguru 製作（© 2026 wquguru，MIT）。影片由作者 repo 的 demo.gif 轉製。\n\nGitHub（含提示詞、測試紀錄、授權）：github.com/wqugu…\n瀏覽器試玩：wquguru.github.io/fable…\nX 上的靈感來源（Felix Rieseberg 的 Saltline，和這篇是不同作品）：x.com/felix…","timestamp":"2026-11-19T07:01:02.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Df6fs-YCaoN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Df6fs-YCaoN","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"131 KB 的 HTML，打開竟然是一個 3D 射擊遊戲。濕地板會反光，地下變電站裡還有三波無人機。👀\n\n這是 wquguru 用 Claude Code＋Fable 5.2 做的 SUBLEVEL 07。比起「一句提示詞」，我更想看後面發生什麼：作者公開的紀錄顯示，這次跑了約 41 分鐘、73 輪，模型還寫腳本去驗證能不能打完三波。\n\n最值得翻的是原始提示詞和執行紀錄。下次想叫 AI 做遊戲，比起只描述畫面，可以先寫清楚：它要怎麼證明自己做出來的東西真的能玩？","timestamp":"2026-11-19T07:00:53.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":5,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"Df7PvV_iCg4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Df7PvV_iCg4","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"有位卡友向高雄市長候選人提問：\n是不是能夠增加公車、快捷公車\n小黃公車來連結市區的台鐵、高鐵、捷運~~~\n\n你的看法是？🧐","timestamp":"2026-11-19T14:00:38.000Z","stats":{"likes":11,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":15,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df7PxZQiB9N","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Df7PxZQiB9N","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"對高雄交通有想法嗎？來聊聊你期待候選人怎麼做🙌\n年輕人都在這裡等你破圈\n馬上到 Dcard 為你支持的候選人發聲 👉 dcard.link/zbgDq…","timestamp":"2026-11-19T14:00:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df7I5xQD10l","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Df7I5xQD10l","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"一位卡友最近開始懷疑\n公司到底是真的想徵人\n還是只是想讓大家覺得公司有在徵人🙂\n\n部門有個職缺已經掛了好幾個月\n每次開會都說目前人力不足\n希望大家先互相支援一下\n等新人進來就會比較好了\n結果等到現在 根本沒看到半個新人\n\n原本一個人負責的事情 現在拆給兩三個人處理\n大家除了自己的工作 還要額外追進度、處理臨時需求\n主管看到事情最後都有完成\n反而開始覺得目前的人力好像也還可以\n甚至有次還聽到：「其實大家效率再提升一點，應該也能應付。」\n\n如果是你還會繼續待嗎？🧐","timestamp":"2026-11-19T13:00:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":10,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df7JutfmKUx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Df7JutfmKUx","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"歡迎過來人分享你的看法\n原文來自✨ #閒聊 公司寧願讓員工做到離職，也不願意找人？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多工作的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-19T13:08:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df7B-zkkVDp","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Df7B-zkkVDp","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"一位卡友好奇\n如果以 25～30 歲的女生來說\n你們認為人生最重要的項目應該怎麼排序？\n\n例如：\n外貌管理（身材、皮膚、穿搭、醫美）\n學歷／進修／考取證照\n事業發展／提升工作能力\n存錢／投資／累積資產\n感情／尋找適合的伴侶\n人際關係／拓展交友圈\n健康管理／運動／作息\n興趣培養／旅行／豐富生活\n\n哪些事情是你們覺得年輕時就應該開始累積的？\n哪些事情反而可以晚一點再做？","timestamp":"2026-11-19T12:00:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df7CAD5ESNo","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Df7CAD5ESNo","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"你會怎麼排👀\n原文來自✨女生在人生不同階段，最重要的事情應該怎麼安排優先順序✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-19T12:00:35.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"Df8spzxlO5w","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df8spzxlO5w","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Gemini 能在 Mac 背景點選單、填表單，滑鼠還是留給你用，也能隨時暫停。這次 Computer Use 首波限美國英文用戶，台灣尚未開放，裝置與訂閱也有門檻。跟一般聊天、自訂技能有何不同？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-20T03:32:32.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T11:59:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df8sqc9FAGn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df8sqc9FAGn","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-20T03:32:37.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T11:59:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df8YuEIk5Bs","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df8YuEIk5Bs","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Gemini 自訂技能把常用指令存起來，還能連結 Drive 等雲端資料、分享給同事，少掉反覆上傳與重打提示詞的麻煩。單一技能附件上限 100 MB，共用文件也得有檢視權限；實際怎麼設定？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-20T00:38:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":6,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T11:59:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df8YuxEk36s","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df8YuxEk36s","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-20T00:38:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T11:59:01+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df7533Eihpz","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df7533Eihpz","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"中國樂見黃仁勳下台？Oculus 創辦人：你們全搞反了\n\nAnduril 老闆拉奇說：中國根本不想讓輝達賣 GPU 給中國公司。路透報導約 60 萬顆 H200 存放在香港等北京核准，北京只放行少量、為了扶植自家晶片產業。\n\n但耶魯管理學院 Sonnenfeld 等人反駁：北京要的是黃仁勳的晶片，而且拿到了。\n\n你站拉奇這邊，還是耶魯這邊？","timestamp":"2026-11-19T20:09:22.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df7FxKfFIVo","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df7FxKfFIVo","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-19T12:33:30.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Df7FwiPlEgQ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df7FwiPlEgQ","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"Apple 公布 2026 App Store Awards 的 45 組決選入圍作品，《明日方舟：終末地》《赤血沙漠》也在名單中。除了 iPhone，Mac、Vision Pro 等平台有哪些值得留意的 App 與遊戲？這回是入圍，得獎結果還要等。文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-19T12:33:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Df6xhVtFIny","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df6xhVtFIny","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-19T09:36:35.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Df6xYOVlBnK","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Df6xYOVlBnK","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"家人不在身邊，遇到詐騙風險怎麼及早知道？趨勢科技「AI 防詐達人家庭守護圈」可在系統判定風險升高時通知成員，但不是每則可疑訊息都會通知，也要先設定權限。這篇實測辨識與提醒流程，哪些地方仍要留意？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-19T09:35:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":1,"shares":2},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[{"id":"Df59R-2AAhF","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/Df59R-2AAhF","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"AI 懶人報從頭到尾都是我一個人＋AI經營的🤖\n\n上個月發現 Opus 5.5 強到爆炸後，把整套流程大改版，一個月發了 40 多支長片、100 多支短影音，YouTube、IG、FB 共增加了 4.5 萬追蹤！\n\n很多人都問為什麼我可以出片那麼快，品質又穩定？！\n\n概念大家都懂，不就是叫 Claude 做，再去調整？\n\n用講的很難三言兩語快速帶完，我把我的血淚經驗跟過程，做成了一個小課程「拆解AI懶人報內容工廠」：12 堂、約一小時，從找熱門題目、寫稿、審稿、畫面、配音到驗證，一步步帶你拆解AI懶人報發片流程的底層邏輯。還直接附上懶人報每天在用的 6 個 skills 和出片程式碼，讓你可以快速用 Claude Code 改成你自己的版本。\n\n當全世界都在教你用AI剪片，我更希望讓你帶走的是，如何把你的流程系統化，讓你不只是會剪出一隻片，而是可以最佳化你每天的流程！\n\n⚠️ 這不是一鍵出片的軟體，是懶人報經營的Skills，你會需要花時間調教成你的樣子！\n\n12/10 前早鳥價 NT$4,590 👇","timestamp":"2026-11-19T02:00:06.000Z","stats":{"likes":97,"replies":8,"reposts":7,"shares":41},"score":134,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df59S82gJF4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/Df59S82gJF4","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"portaly.cc/ailrb…","timestamp":"2026-11-19T02:00:14.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":6},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df3m8g4IyHE","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/Df3m8g4IyHE","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"到Google找前同事吃飯\n\n結果沒想到說有組員極神工程師也是AI懶人報忠實聽眾，有機會聊聊神人們AI時代開發的做法，也分享懶人報平常怎麼經營的。\n\n其實蠻感動的，沒想到懶人報的資訊可以對這麼厲害的人也有價值，更沒想到自己聊起來並沒有覺得有Gap，也算是看到了自己的成長🔥\n\n如果你還沒聽過AI懶人報的Podcast/Youtube，真心推推！ 發現大家其實不反對AI內容，反對的是沒有價值的Slops，很開心很多人回饋給我喜歡懶人報的內容，都是讓我持續做下去的動力🫶\n\n但其實今天最大的收穫還是：Google伙食真低好吃，遲早有天要來Google工作的😂","timestamp":"2026-11-18T04:06:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":577,"replies":27,"reposts":12,"shares":43},"score":667,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"Df7Me8an1i6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Df7Me8an1i6","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"廠商們，AI 都幫你們設計好了\n\n這鍵帽如果聯名成功應該很讚\n\n如果到時候用電腦玩，星星數可以直接顯示在鍵盤上...","timestamp":"2026-11-19T13:32:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df3ojD8D3sz","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Df3ojD8D3sz","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"OpenAI 這次的 Sol 6.2、Astra 6.2 雖然被噴爛\n還是有肉眼可見的進步啦\n\n前端的審美終於有好一點\n讓 AI 盲測也說是最『耐看』的\n但擺在 Opus 旁邊就是沒那麼吸引人\n\n另外這種簡單前端場景\nAstra 不見得比 Sol 好\n\n明天再來公布這四個模型各自是誰","timestamp":"2026-11-18T04:23:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":41,"replies":4,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":49,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df5_ONikbAJ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Df5_ONikbAJ","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"答案揭曉：\nAstra 6.2 > Sol 6.2 > Astra 6 > Opus 5.5\n\n這次 6.2 系列有自帶一個國文課本插畫風格\n算有特色，但好不好看就個人主觀了","timestamp":"2026-11-19T02:17:04.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df2Hutej_Ar","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/Df2Hutej_Ar","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"今天看到 Kanban 這個字時\n多想了兩下，到底為何叫 Kanban?\n\n而且居然就是台語的招牌\n\n1950年代有個日本人 - 大野耐一\n從同事帶回的美國超市照片中獲得靈感\n先在豐田推動「超市式補貨」\n後續到美國才終於親眼見到超市\n\n這套機制後來也成為豐田 TPS（Toyota Production System）的核心工具之一\n\n簡單來說就是有需求才製造，有空間才補庫存\n最大化的避免庫存堆積，或是生產線塞車\n\n現在更常出現在線上軟體或服務的視野裡\nTrello 著名的卡片呈現方式就是一種 Kanban\n\n下次在 Trello 或 Linear 把卡片往右拖的時候\n可以想想，你的看板是在限制 WIP 拉動流程\n還是只是把便利貼換個地方貼而已？","timestamp":"2026-11-17T14:14:42.000Z","stats":{"likes":32,"replies":4,"reposts":3,"shares":3},"score":49,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[{"id":"Df2t84ok5l6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@c.yu.an_/post/Df2t84ok5l6","username":"c.yu.an_","displayName":"c.yu.an_","content":"本日領悟：賣煎蛋的店，也可以賣炒蛋\n不用只賣已經有的東西，可以賣可以做到的東西","timestamp":"2026-11-17T19:48:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":0},"score":8,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"Df2i8smExYY","url":"https://www.threads.com/@c.yu.an_/post/Df2i8smExYY","username":"c.yu.an_","displayName":"c.yu.an_","content":"今天是我認識 @zet.lu  的一週年","timestamp":"2026-11-17T18:12:17.000Z","stats":{"likes":11,"replies":2,"reposts":2,"shares":0},"score":21,"first_seen":"2026-11-20T05:13:07+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}